.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.TH OCTA-BRIDGE 1 "" "OCTA-CAPTURE @PROJECT_VERSION@" "OCTA-CAPTURE Manual"
.SH NAME
octa\-bridge \- run the persistent device-backend line protocol
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBocta-bridge\fR [CTRL-PORT]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Backend process used by the control panel, reading bounded request-ID command lines
from standard input and emitting JSON replies/events on standard output.
It keeps one exclusive CTRL session, validates commands and separates meter events
from solicited replies. Some commands change device parameters or start Auto-Sens.
Use the graphical panel or typed command-line tools for ordinary control.
.PP
This is a local process protocol, not a network service. Its framing and operation
reference is doc/gui-backend.md in the source repository.
.PP
The default CTRL MIDI port is hw:CARD=OCTACAPTURE,DEV=0,SUBDEV=1. Close other control-panel/CTRL clients before opening it. Audio streaming is independent of this connection.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success; nonzero indicates a usage, device or operation error.
.SH SEE ALSO
octa-capture(1), octa-status(1), octa-preset(1)
